      "publicDescription": "* Apply and adjust design principles.\n* Adjust behaviour of with(DAY_OF_MONTH, int).\n* Adding months or years to BritishCutover now resolves a day in the cutover gap (3 to 13 September 1752) back to the previous valid day (2 September 1752), rather than forward.\n* Fix  prolepticYear(...) for large values.\n* Add tests.\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Corrected day-of-month adjustments and date arithmetic in the Julian and British cutover calendars, including dates around the September 1752 calendar gap.\n  * Fixed period calculations across the British cutover and improved handling of year-of-era values that exceed supported limits.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Clarified how calendar dates are validated and adjusted when a requested day is missing.",
